      "**Trusted repos**: everything under /Users/praveenkumar/Documents/projects (private additiv-implementations clones and the Hydrogen source monorepo) — confidential material is fine there; secrets and personal/entrusted sensitive data are never cleared into a repo regardless of visibility",
